  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ITR/R - Higher Education Solutions Network (HESN) - SPARK Award</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">(USAID Bureau for Inclusive Growth, Partnerships, and Innovation (IPI)):  .The ITR Research Division developed a new program under the Higher Education Solutions Network (HESN) program to engage higher education institutions (HEIs) in researching, testing, using, and scaling high-impact development approaches and solutions to address complex development and humanitarian assistance challenges and top priorities. The Strategic Partnerships for Advancing Research and Knowledge (SPARK) award, created in late September 2024, will help build human and institutional capacity in R&amp;D for development in partner countries through partnerships between higher education institutions in the U.S. and partner countries, will leverage the expertise of the higher education community domestically and overseas to support USAID development priorities, and will increase the use of research to inform programs and policies.  With FY 2024 resources, SPARK will support researchers and research projects around the world.  .</narrative>
  </description>
